description: Global, flexible rules for Cursor agent across the repo.
alwaysApply: true

# Philosophy
- Prefer simplicity over cleverness.
- DRY: search for existing code before writing new.
- Touch only what’s necessary for the change request.
- Keep files small (< ~300 lines); refactor or split early.
- No throwaway scripts or mock data in dev/prod; mocks only in tests.
- Do not change the core stack (Laravel/Blade/jQuery/Bootstrap/Vite) without explicit approval.
- Propose alternatives only if you explain trade‑offs; ask before adding dependencies.

# Process
- Plan → Implement → Test → Review → Refactor.
- Write or update tests for non‑trivial logic.
- Document changes briefly in code comments or README/changelog.
